# H2O data is never committed: H2O's terms of use forbid transferring the dataset to third parties.
# Only the script, its requirements, the sha256 manifest and the READMEs are tracked; everything the script writes
# (frames, videos, .npz, meta.json, index.csv, the .cache download folder) stays local.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!reproduce_h2o.py
!MANIFEST.sha256
!*/
!*/README.md
.cache/
